OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMost areas
OL,6,Fwill see some clear spells during the
OL,7,Ffirst half of the night with light
OL,8,Fwinds. Some mist and fog will form
OL,9,Fduring the latter half. A chilly night
OL,10,Fin rural areas and winds remaining
OL,11,Flight.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FA foggy start to Sunday for
OL,14,Fmost, and remaining generally dull and
OL,15,Fmisty into the afternoon. Outbreaks of
OL,16,Frain and drizzle will move through
OL,17,Ffrom the north overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
