OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FEarly
OL,6,Fcloud and rain clearing Kent Monday
OL,7,Fmorning. Some sunshine most days, with
OL,8,Fa moderate to fresh breeze. Showers
OL,9,Fpossible, especially near some coasts,
OL,10,Fwhere winds will be strong.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
